OL,3,A'We have more work to do', says Canada
OL,4,Anegotiator as US trade deadline looms
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanada-US trade minister Dominic
OL,7,FLeBlanc said negotiators "have more
OL,8,Fwork to do" as he left a meeting with
OL,9,FUS counterparts ahead of a midnight
OL,10,Fdeadline to finalise a tentative trade
OL,11,Fdeal with the Trump administration.
OL,13,F"We're going to continue working up
OL,14,Funtil the last minute," he told
OL,15,Freporters in Washington on Friday
OL,16,Fevening. "Our job is not finished."
OL,18,FNegotiators have until Friday night to
OL,19,Fhammer out the details of the deal or
OL,20,Frisk a fresh wave of additional US
OL,21,Ftariffs on a wide range of Canadian
OL,22,Fgoods.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
