OL,3,A'We have more work to do', says Canada
OL,4,Anegotiator as US trade deadline looms
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeBlanc spent some eight hours in
OL,7,Fmeetings with US trade representative
OL,8,FJamieson Greer and other negotiators -
OL,9,Fone of the longest sessions so far as
OL,10,Ftalks go down to the wire.
